# Runesword's controller may target an opponent's attacking creature. Bot1 pumps Bot2's attacking Hill Giant and blocks it
# with its own Hill Giant: the pumped Giant's damage kills Bot1's Giant, which is exiled instead of dying (the replacement
# is about whatever creature the targeted one deals damage to, whoever controls it), while Bot2's Giant, dealt damage by
# the other one, dies as usual. It left the battlefield this turn, so Bot1 sacrifices Runesword (CR 603.7c, 701.21a).
